{"id":"729184c70b2e1c60","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/030_Russell_分支类型论_RTT.md","title":"030 Russell 分支类型论 RTT","display":"030_Russell_分支类型论_RTT","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-分支类型\">1. 分支类型</h1>\n<p>形状集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Shape}\">\\(\\mathsf{Shape}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_i\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\">\\(\\sigma_i\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\">\\(\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Shape}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>约定自然数有限子集的空最大值为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max\\varnothing=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max\\varnothing=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义形状阶数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\iota)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\iota)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle)\n=\n1+\\max_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle)\n=\n1+\\max_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>特别地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\rangle)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\rangle)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分支类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTy}=\\{(\\sigma,r):\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Shape},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r\\ge\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RTy}=\\{(\\sigma,r):\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Shape},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r\\ge\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}=\\{x_i^\\rho:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}=\\{x_i^\\rho:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\)</span> 有限，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\rho}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\rho}(X)\\)</span> 为同类型最小编号新变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>类型化项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\\)</span> 只由变量项生成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在公式闭包之前定义谓词应用良构谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,r\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\sigma:m\\to\\mathsf{Shape}\\,\\exists s:m\\to\\mathbb N\\,\n\\Bigl((\\langle\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(m-1)\\rangle,r)\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\n\\land P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\langle\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(m-1)\\rangle,r)}\n\\land\\vec t:m\\to\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (t_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\sigma(i),s(i))}\\land s(i)&lt;r)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,r\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\sigma:m\\to\\mathsf{Shape}\\,\\exists s:m\\to\\mathbb N\\,\n\\Bigl((\\langle\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(m-1)\\rangle,r)\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\n\\land P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\langle\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(m-1)\\rangle,r)}\n\\land\\vec t:m\\to\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (t_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\sigma(i),s(i))}\\land s(i)&lt;r)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t)\">\\(\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 1 条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i&lt;r\">\\(s_i&lt;r\\)</span> 是分支限制；违反该条件的应用不是公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>全文类型参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\)</span> 均取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTy}\">\\(\\mathsf{RTy}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Var}_\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Var}_\\eta)\\)</span>；公式自由、绑定变量函数的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，值域同为该有限幂集。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\rho\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\rho\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\">\\(u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\\)</span>，项替换作用于所有类型的项并保持被替换项的类型；公式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT}\\)</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\rho\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\rho\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}\\)</span>，返回同一公式载体。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1})\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\\)</span> 的显示缩写，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t:m\\to\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\eta}\">\\(\\vec t:m\\to\\bigcup_\\eta\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\eta}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项自由变量为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(P)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t_i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(P)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t_i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P\\left(\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P\\left(\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}))=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,t_0,\\ldots,t_{m-1}))=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{eqI}(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。</p>\n<p>同类型项替换定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec u)[x:=t]\n=\n\\operatorname{predapp}(P[x:=t],u_0[x:=t],\\ldots,u_{m-1}[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec u)[x:=t]\n=\n\\operatorname{predapp}(P[x:=t],u_0[x:=t],\\ldots,u_{m-1}[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eqI}(s,u)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{eqI}(s[x:=t],u[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eqI}(s,u)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{eqI}(s[x:=t],u[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=t],B[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=t],B[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词替换子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)\n\\quad\\text{若 }y=x,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)\n\\quad\\text{若 }y=x,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A[x:=t])\n\\quad\\text{若 }y\\ne x\\text{ 且 }y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A[x:=t])\n\\quad\\text{若 }y\\ne x\\text{ 且 }y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]\n=\n\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(z,A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)][x:=t])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A)[x:=t]\n=\n\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(z,A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)][x:=t])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\rho}((\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\rho}((\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义同分支类型绑定变量改名根步</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A),\n\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])):\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\\land x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\n\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A),\n\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])):\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\\land x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\n\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{RTT}\\)</span> 为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}^{2}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}^{2}\\)</span> 中包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\\)</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eqI}\">\\(\\operatorname{eqI}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}\\)</span> 构造子相容的等价关系集合。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT}(A,x,t)=A[x:=t],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT}(A,x,t)=A[x:=t],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>类型化量词公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,B)):\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,B)):\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>个体等号公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}=\\{s=t\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{(\\iota,0)},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}=\\{s=t\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{(\\iota,0)},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,(\\iota,0)},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则与证明\">5. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则关系为 MP、分支类型化全称推广与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RTT}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RTT}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT}=\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT}=\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限公式序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=A\\to B\">\\(p(j)=A\\to B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\">\\(p(k)=\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(C)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}p(k)\">\\(p(i)\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}p(k)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>推导记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\\)</span> 由第 7.1 节的证明对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 解释，不额外引入规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-$\\alpha$-闭包与分支限制\">6. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 闭包与分支限制</h1>\n<p>关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT}\\)</span> 是所有包含第 3 节 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT}\\)</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eqI}\">\\(\\operatorname{eqI}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}\\)</span> 构造子相容的等价关系的交集。</p>\n<p>谓词应用形成条款中的侧条件</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_i&lt;r\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_i&lt;r\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是对象语言良构条件；若某个参数类型等级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\">\\(s_i\\)</span> 不小于谓词分支等级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>，则对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{predapp}\">\\(\\operatorname{predapp}\\)</span> 不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>该条件正是第 2 节已经前置并用于公式最小闭包的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-目标区分条款\">7. 目标区分条款</h1>\n<h1 id=\"7.1-分支层级与证明对象\">7.1 分支层级与证明对象</h1>\n<p>分支类型层级对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Level}_{RTT}\n=\n\\{((\\sigma,r),s):(\\sigma,r)\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\\land s=r\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Level}_{RTT}\n=\n\\{((\\sigma,r),s):(\\sigma,r)\\in\\mathsf{RTy}\\land s=r\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>带假设侧条件的规则对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT}\n\\cup\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(C)\\}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT}\n\\cup\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}_{\\rho}(x,A)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT}(C)\\}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>行许可和证明对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land k&lt;n\n\\land\n\\bigl(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n\\lor\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists e:r\\to k\\,\\exists\\vec A:r\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\ (\\forall i&lt;r\\ \\vec A(i)=p(e(i)))\\land \n((\\vec A),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\land k&lt;n\n\\land\n\\bigl(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n\\lor\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists e:r\\to k\\,\\exists\\vec A:r\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\ (\\forall i&lt;r\\ \\vec A(i)=p(e(i)))\\land \n((\\vec A),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}:n&gt;0\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT}(\\Gamma,p,k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}:n&gt;0\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT}(\\Gamma,p,k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>推导关系与闭包算子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\,\\exists p\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\\\n\\bigl(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\land p(n-1)=A\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\,\\exists p\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\\\n\\bigl(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\\land p(n-1)=A\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{RTT}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分条件在分支形成、改名根步和证明对象全部确定后定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{RTT}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{RTy}=\\{(\\sigma,r):\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Shape},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r\\ge\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma)\\}\n\\land\n\\forall P,\\vec t\\,\n(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t))\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{RTT}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{RTy}=\\{(\\sigma,r):\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Shape},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r\\ge\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma)\\}\n\\land\n\\forall P,\\vec t\\,\n(\\operatorname{predapp}(P,\\vec t)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t))\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条件保留 Russell 分支等级，不加入可约性坍缩公理；它区别于 CTT 的非分支类型结构，也区别于 031 中加入可约性公理的版本。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RTT}\n=\n(\n\\operatorname{ord}_0,\n(\\operatorname{fresh}_\\rho)_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\mathsf{Shape},\n\\mathsf{RTy},\n\\{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\}_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}},\n\\mathsf{Level}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT},\n\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT},\n\\vdash_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{RTT},\n\\Delta_{RTT}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{RTT}\n=\n(\n\\operatorname{ord}_0,\n(\\operatorname{fresh}_\\rho)_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\mathsf{Shape},\n\\mathsf{RTy},\n\\{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\}_{\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RTy}},\n\\mathsf{Level}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{RTT},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{RTT},\n\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{RTT},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{RTT},\n\\vdash_{RTT},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{RTT},\n\\Delta_{RTT}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 Russell 分支类型句法、公理和有限证明；不含可约性公理、简单类型坍缩或语义解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-分支类型","text":"1. 分支类型","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则与证明","text":"5. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"6.-$\\alpha$-闭包与分支限制","text":"6. $\\alpha$ 闭包与分支限制","level":1},{"id":"7.-目标区分条款","text":"7. 目标区分条款","level":1},{"id":"7.1-分支层级与证明对象","text":"7.1 分支层级与证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Shape}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\mathsf{Shape}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_i\\in\\mathsf{Shape}","display":false},{"tex":"i<m","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Shape}","display":false},{"tex":"\\max\\varnothing=0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\iota)=0,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{m-1}\\rangle)\n=\n1+\\max_{i<m}\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\langle\\rangle)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RTy}=\\{(\\sigma,r):\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Shape},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r\\ge\\operatorname{ord}_0(\\sigma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}=\\{x_i^\\rho:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\rho}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\rho}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{RTT,\\rho}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PredAppOK}_{RTT}(P,\\vec t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m,r\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\sigma:m\\to\\mathsf{Shape}\\,\\exists s:m\\to\\mathbb N\\,\n\\Bigl((\\langle\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(m-1)\\rangle,r)\\in\\m